  "description": "\"Your marriage registration has been completed.\"\n\n I don't even have anyone to marry, yet I've suddenly become a married person. \n\nWith whom on earth? \n\nYeon-du's grandfather and Mr. Gu's grandfather were best friends. Ever since Yeon-du was little, her grandfather would say that when she grew up, he'd send her off to marry into the Gu family. It was naturally just a thing of the past to adult Yeon-du, until she realized that she slept with Lee Beom, the second son of the Gu family, while drunk. \n\nOn top of that, a marriage registration?! What on earth am I supposed to do?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/marriage_accident), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wedding_accident)",
